data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Integrating Statistical Physics**\n\nI'm now integrating insights from statistical physics. I'm recalling Feyerabend's *Against Method* (1975) and its emphasis on methodological pluralism for breakthroughs. I'm also now planning to integrate Kirkpatrick, Gelatt & Vecchi (1983) and their focus on simulated annealing.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 588,"totalTokenCount": 10549,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 588}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 9961,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-neon","responseId": "2gMDa9HmCp2p5NoPmO3w6A4"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Integrating Landscape Strategies**\n\nI'm now considering how rugged landscapes impact search methods. I'm focusing on local search being trapped, and how noise or landscape modifications help, recalling \"The Mechanism of Stochastic Resonance\" (Benzi, Sutera & Vulpiani, 1981). I also need to note the absence of a defined energy function, and how random search could outperform a structured search!\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 588,"totalTokenCount": 10831,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 588}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 10243,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-neon","responseId": "2gMDa9HmCp2p5NoPmO3w6A4"}

data: {"candidates": [{"content": {"parts": [{"text": "**Refining Insight Correlations**\n\nI'm now integrating insights from EEG studies on creative cognition and \"insight\" moments. I am recalling the studies of Beaty et al. (2016, 2018), and Jung-Beeman et al. (2004) showing brain network dynamics related to co-activation. I'll need to note the alpha wave burst of insight.\n\n\n","thought": true}],"role": "model"},"index": 0}],"usageMetadata": {"promptTokenCount": 588,"totalTokenCount": 11130,"promptTokensDetails": [{"modality": "TEXT","tokenCount": 588}],"thoughtsTokenCount": 10542,"serviceTier": "standard"},"modelVersion": "gemini-4-neon","responseId": "2gMDa9HmCp2p5NoPmO3w6A4"}

